      "phase": "always",
      "perspective": "neutral",
      "keywords": [],
      "modifiers": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Strident War Cry",
      "timing": "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a CHARGE ability for an anointed unit",
      "text": "Used By: That anointed unit.\nPick a friendly non-HERO DAUGHTERS OF KHAINE unit that is not in combat, is wholly within 12\" of that anointed unit and has not charged this turn to be the target. If that anointed unit charges, after that CHARGE ability has been resolved, the target can immediately use the ‘Charge’ ability even if it is not your charge phase. In addition, you can re-roll charge rolls for the target for the rest of the phase.",
