    {
      "name": "Anointed Ritualist",
      "timing": "Start of First Battle Round",
      "text": "The target is anointed for the rest of the battle, even if it has been destroyed. Friendly anointed units on the battlefield treat EXALTED abilities on the warscrolls of friendly anointed units that have been destroyed as if they were on their warscrolls.",
